1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Earth is 4.5 billion years old. This planet is under 1 million.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Elias 2-24 b, the youngest planet ever found

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:13,500
Younger than any known world

4
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:17,500
It beats the previous youngest planet by a wide margin

5
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:21,500
About 2 Jupiter masses

6
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:25,500
About 450 light-years away

7
